{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2663d57778bdaa120eb2d5a583315ecfd13b7080.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2x+2}-3^{x+3}-3^{x}+3=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"201\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/7666c6fd233e252a4d5318821efc8b0b20208c3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)} 0 \\qquad  \\text {(B)} 1 \\qquad  \\text {(C)} 2 \\qquad  \\text {(D)} 3 \\qquad  \\text {(E)} 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"303\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/2737c8a4a182c99a41835a041e4e3c7118cc6d51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3^x$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />. Then the preceding equation can be expressed as the quadratic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/2/422ab93927f22c8a9b3a9f52cbfa13901dc24fe1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9a^2-28a+3 = 0\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" /> Solving the quadratic yields the roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d3dba22edcee4ff7213635505e90128beebb42e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />. Setting these equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da6adae81e3e997a341d58f78f957dbf0459b0ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^x$\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" />, we can immediately see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5e8656291085c388b48a0fa8da85aed21c483bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy the equation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=